From 379213863091537bf6b6c1aedc2efa00da97c0b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Ponguta <sergioponguta@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 14:59:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kovalla): hover trailers only play Latin American Spanish
 ones

- Home and folder hover took the first trailer of any language: the English one from the
  catalog or TMDB, or the Spain dub the stock metadata addons carry as lang es / es-ES.
- New findLatinoTrailerYtId asks the meta addons by IMDb id and keeps only lang es-419
  (or another es-XX except es-ES); titles without one play nothing.
- A lookup shared with the screen's own source-sufficient request answered with a meta that has
  no trailers, so folder hover missed silently; retry up to three times when that happens.
